1
00:00:53,300 --> 00:00:53,760
My wife.

2
00:00:54,360 --> 00:00:55,560
Do I look good in this?

3
00:00:57,960 --> 00:01:00,360
It looks better than your usual black robe.

4
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:03,260
After all, my wife picked it out herself.

5
00:01:03,630 --> 00:01:04,500
Wearing it

6
00:01:05,400 --> 00:01:06,260
warms my heart.

7
00:01:09,130 --> 00:01:10,860
Our previous wedding was a lie.

8
00:01:10,900 --> 00:01:11,900
It doesn't count.

9
00:01:12,130 --> 00:01:13,190
Today, right here,

10
00:01:13,560 --> 00:01:14,900
let's use tea instead of wine.

11
00:01:14,900 --> 00:01:15,230
No.

12
00:01:15,700 --> 00:01:16,560
Let's use wine.

13
00:01:17,330 --> 00:01:18,860
Let's have a proper wedding

14
00:01:19,500 --> 00:01:21,360
and drink the cross-cupped wine.

15
00:01:21,660 --> 00:01:23,830
From now on, I will be your rightful husband.

16
00:01:23,830 --> 00:01:24,160
Okay?

17
00:01:34,030 --> 00:01:34,430
Baili.

18
00:01:34,660 --> 00:01:35,060
Baili!

19
00:01:40,900 --> 00:01:41,500
Yaomo!

20
00:01:41,729 --> 00:01:42,729
Come here immediately!

21
00:01:42,729 --> 00:01:43,300
Hurry!

22
00:02:01,200 --> 00:02:01,800
How is she?

23
00:02:02,300 --> 00:02:03,830
Why did she suddenly faint?

24
00:02:03,830 --> 00:02:06,500
Is it an injury from the previous Heavenly Realm war?

25
00:02:06,500 --> 00:02:06,960
My Lord.

26
00:02:08,130 --> 00:02:09,000
Lady Baili...

27
00:02:09,699 --> 00:02:11,160
Her divine veins are gone.

28
00:02:12,560 --> 00:02:13,490
What did you say?

29
00:02:14,460 --> 00:02:15,530
The ancient divine veins

30
00:02:15,530 --> 00:02:16,730
are completely gone.

31
00:02:18,130 --> 00:02:19,660
Her immortal roots are destroyed.

32
00:02:19,660 --> 00:02:21,200
Although her meridians are intact,

33
00:02:21,200 --> 00:02:23,260
her foundation is completely empty.

34
00:02:23,400 --> 00:02:25,329
She is just an ordinary mortal now.

35
00:02:26,030 --> 00:02:28,060
Ordinary mortals faint when exhausted,

36
00:02:28,060 --> 00:02:30,030
let alone her fighting consecutive battles

37
00:02:30,030 --> 00:02:31,460
and traveling long distances.

38
00:02:31,460 --> 00:02:33,390
Her body couldn't take it anymore.

39
00:02:39,530 --> 00:02:41,000
What exactly is going on?

40
00:02:42,230 --> 00:02:43,630
Explain it to me clearly.

41
00:02:43,829 --> 00:02:45,030
Reporting to My Lord.

42
00:02:45,329 --> 00:02:47,030
Her Highness the God of War specifically ordered us

43
00:02:47,030 --> 00:02:48,460
to keep this a secret from you.

44
00:02:48,460 --> 00:02:50,120
We didn't mean to deceive you.

45
00:02:54,560 --> 00:02:55,360
The God of War,

46
00:02:56,360 --> 00:02:57,160
to save you,

47
00:02:57,829 --> 00:02:59,630
traded her ancient divine veins

48
00:02:59,829 --> 00:03:01,430
for the Nirvana Bodhi Fruit.

49
00:03:03,630 --> 00:03:04,400
So

50
00:03:05,530 --> 00:03:06,460
that's how it is.

51
00:03:18,700 --> 00:03:19,230
Baili.

52
00:03:23,700 --> 00:03:25,360
It seems you know everything.

53
00:03:26,800 --> 00:03:27,930
Why are you so silly?

54
00:03:28,829 --> 00:03:29,890
Why are you crying?

55
00:03:30,329 --> 00:03:31,390
I'm fine, aren't I?

56
00:03:33,900 --> 00:03:36,630
How could you trade your divine veins for my life?

57
00:03:40,000 --> 00:03:42,030
I couldn't just watch you die.

58
00:03:42,300 --> 00:03:43,430
Don't get too proud.

59
00:03:43,829 --> 00:03:45,060
From now on, you have to cook,

60
00:03:45,060 --> 00:03:45,860
chop wood,

61
00:03:45,900 --> 00:03:46,700
farm,

62
00:03:46,829 --> 00:03:47,800
and support me.

63
00:03:49,130 --> 00:03:50,930
Compared to being the God of War,

64
00:03:50,960 --> 00:03:53,730
I'd rather live a peaceful life with you here.

65
00:03:57,800 --> 00:03:58,200
Okay.

66
00:03:58,800 --> 00:03:59,800
I will support you

67
00:04:00,200 --> 00:04:01,460
for the rest of my life.

68
00:04:15,030 --> 00:04:15,830
Eat more.

69
00:04:16,160 --> 00:04:17,290
Your body is weak now

70
00:04:17,300 --> 00:04:18,329
and needs nourishment.

71
00:04:18,329 --> 00:04:20,300
In a few days, I'll catch a chicken from the back mountain

72
00:04:20,300 --> 00:04:21,959
and make chicken soup for you.

73
00:04:24,830 --> 00:04:25,530
Can you?

74
00:04:26,360 --> 00:04:28,560
Last time you even burned the porridge.

75
00:04:28,560 --> 00:04:29,360
Don't worry.

76
00:04:29,900 --> 00:04:31,860
I recently learned from Aunt Wang in the village.

77
00:04:31,860 --> 00:04:33,590
I promise it will be delicious.

78
00:04:42,100 --> 00:04:42,830
Eat slowly.

79
00:04:43,260 --> 00:04:44,830
No one is fighting you for it.

80
00:04:44,830 --> 00:04:46,060
From now on, three meals a day,

81
00:04:46,060 --> 00:04:47,530
I will cook them for you every day.

82
00:04:47,530 --> 00:04:49,730
I will never let you suffer from hunger or fatigue again.

83
00:04:49,730 --> 00:04:51,260
I used to protect the common people.

84
00:04:51,260 --> 00:04:51,920
From now on,

85
00:04:52,000 --> 00:04:53,100
we will watch peach blossoms in spring,

86
00:04:53,100 --> 00:04:54,130
enjoy the evening breeze in summer,

87
00:04:54,130 --> 00:04:55,130
harvest fruits in autumn,

88
00:04:55,130 --> 00:04:56,330
and brew warm tea in winter.

89
00:04:56,330 --> 00:04:57,260
Year after year,

90
00:04:57,360 --> 00:04:58,490
I want you by my side.

91
00:04:59,300 --> 00:05:00,760
I will definitely be there.

92
00:05:00,760 --> 00:05:02,020
For the rest of my life,

93
00:05:02,160 --> 00:05:03,460
I will only live for you.
